        <senderName>Environment Canada</senderName>
        <headline>squall warning in effect</headline>
        <description>
Squalls with wind gusts up to 35 knots are expected or occurring in the area.

As of 2:58 p.m. EDT, a line of showers and thunderstorms located from Napanee to 24 nautical miles south of Trenton is moving southeast at 30 knots.

###

Please continue to monitor alerts and forecasts issued by Environment Canada. For more information monitor Canadian Coast Guard radio or Weatheradio stations.
</description>
